cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Gaussian fluctuations for Internal DLA on cylinders: a Lean 4 formalization"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 / mathlib formalization of the paper "Gaussian fluctuations for
  Internal DLA on cylinders" (Bou-Rabee, Silvestri, Yadin, arXiv:2604.21142).
  All four main results are proved: the maximal fluctuation bound (Theorem
  1.1), the Gaussian fluctuations of the occupation field (Theorem 1.3) and
  its cycle and torus examples. The two results the paper cites are proved as
  well: McLeish's martingale central limit theorem, in the Lattice-Probability
  library, and Silvestri's Proposition 2, here. The paper's reduction
  pr:reduction, whose printed proof has a gap, is proved by a different
  argument, together with three stronger forms that are not in the paper.
  Every registered statement is proved and depends only on Lean's standard
  axioms, and the four main theorems are checked by Mathlib-only comparator
  challenges.
type: software
authors:
